[SIZE="4"][B]Changelog[/B][/SIZE]

[B]2026-10-28 — 3.1.1-0.3[/B]

[LIST]
[*]ADB serial in recovery is now [B]LGOTMS[/B] followed by the serial number (for example LGOTMS4c662259), the same as in the ROM and in stock. Before, recovery showed the bare serial, so adb saw two different devices in one session. Done by init.recovery.e0.rc, which writes the USB iSerial once ro.serialno is set.
[/LIST]

